WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.112 --> 00:00:17.741
Auditor packs are frozen snapshots of evidence and decisions, each with a hash.

2
00:00:20.489 --> 00:00:23.817
Build a pack by choosing a title, frameworks and systems.

3
00:00:27.431 --> 00:00:30.716
Build pack stays disabled until all three are filled.

4
00:00:33.113 --> 00:00:35.524
We will not build one in the demo, so cancel.

5
00:00:37.648 --> 00:00:41.211
An auditor checks a downloaded pack offline with one command.
